.TH CAPGET 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
capget \- reads linux thread capabilities using the kernel header and data layout
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/capability.h>
.B int capget(cap_user_header_t header, cap_user_data_t data);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads Linux thread capabilities using the kernel header and data layout. Versions 2 and 3 require two data elements.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result on success, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR capget (2)
